-- Five lookalikes of `▷` — `▶ ▹ ▸ ▻ ⊳` — and five of `◁` — `◀ ◃ ◂ ◅ ⊲` —
-- (language.md §12.7): each is invalid_character naming it and the triangle
-- to write, and is read as that pipe, so the pipelines parse (7:9, 8:9, 9:9,
-- 10:9, 11:9, 15:20, 15:36, 15:53, 15:67, 15:84).
right xs =
    xs
        ▶ List.reverse
        ▹ List.length
        ▸ String.fromInt
        ▻ String.length
        ⊳ String.fromInt


left s =
    String.fromInt ◀ String.length ◃ String.reverse ◂ String.trim ◅ String.toUpper ⊲ s
